1
00:01:34,079 --> 00:01:37,400
Band-Aids, for bruises and sprains

2
00:01:38,599 --> 00:01:39,640
Iodine.

3
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:41,879
Why can't you wish me well?

4
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,040
Take care.

5
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:47,200
Thanks.

6
00:01:50,079 --> 00:01:51,040
Zhao Yijie.

7
00:01:58,319 --> 00:01:59,920
It's pretty lively here.

8
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,280
This is nice, this one.

9
00:02:06,599 --> 00:02:08,120
This place used to be a karaoke room.

10
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:15,280
I haven't eaten.

11
00:02:16,879 --> 00:02:17,719
Make me a bowl.

12
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,039
I've got ready-made Luosifen.

13
00:02:19,039 --> 00:02:20,000
Cook it yourself if you want some.

14
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,560
Perfect.

15
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,039
What happened to you?

16
00:02:31,159 --> 00:02:31,960
Do you have a mirror?

17
00:02:41,039 --> 00:02:42,960
You really trained a good protégé.

18
00:02:44,159 --> 00:02:44,840
Ding Ning.

19
00:02:45,599 --> 00:02:47,080
She's already left the firm.

20
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:48,719
You're not here for compensation, are you?

21
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,400
Twelve years and three months.

22
00:02:57,639 --> 00:02:58,719
You have a really good memory.

23
00:02:59,639 --> 00:02:59,960
Yeah.

24
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:02,759
We haven't met in 12 years and 3 months.

25
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:06,159
Being so nostalgic...

26
00:03:06,159 --> 00:03:07,639
...isn't like you.

27
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,639
Getting off work?

28
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:13,400
Yeah, I'm off work.

29
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:14,599
I'm heading out now.

30
00:03:14,639 --> 00:03:15,759
Okay, bye.

31
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:17,439
Bye, see you tomorrow.

32
00:03:17,439 --> 00:03:18,120
Bye.

33
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:22,280
Relaxed and simple.

34
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,120
Looks like you're doing pretty well.

35
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,479
I have plenty of Luosifen here.

36
00:03:27,479 --> 00:03:28,319
Take two boxes.

37
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:31,479
And fish, soy sauce duck, and sausage.

38
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,719
Don't hold back here.

39
00:03:38,039 --> 00:03:39,479
How have you been all these years?

40
00:03:42,039 --> 00:03:43,319
Have you been under a lot of pressure?

41
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,599
I got used to it a long time ago.

42
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:50,159
Are you here to ask for my help?

43
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:50,879
No.

44
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:55,919
Between you and me...

45
00:03:57,639 --> 00:03:58,879
...neither of us can help the other.

46
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,960
Lately, I just keep remembering...

47
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,439
...things from when we were young.

48
00:04:08,159 --> 00:04:10,080
I keep thinking about those three cows.

49
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:18,680
It really brings back memories.

50
00:04:20,759 --> 00:04:22,120
So I just wanted to come see you.

51
00:04:22,959 --> 00:04:23,920
Are you doing okay?

52
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:30,800
My current life is exactly what I want.

53
00:04:40,639 --> 00:04:41,920
Tell me, what if...

54
00:04:44,759 --> 00:04:46,319
...if back then, the two of us...

55
00:04:48,759 --> 00:04:49,600
...had traded places?

56
00:04:54,439 --> 00:04:56,680
Would we be completely different now?

57
00:04:59,000 --> 00:04:59,759
Impossible.

58
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:01,480
Everyone has their own destiny.

59
00:05:01,639 --> 00:05:02,920
You are you, and I am me.

60
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,079
I couldn't become you...

61
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,759
...and you could never become me.

62
00:05:15,839 --> 00:05:17,800
Even though we're middle-aged now...

63
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:20,240
...the road ahead is still very long.

64
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:21,839
If you really want to change something...

65
00:05:21,879 --> 00:05:22,680
...there's still plenty of time.

66
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,759
All right, all right, all right.

67
00:05:24,759 --> 00:05:26,000
I'm starving.

68
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,560
Everyone has their own destiny.

69
00:06:49,839 --> 00:06:50,519
Dad.

70
00:06:50,879 --> 00:06:53,360
After learning about you and Awu,

71
00:06:53,959 --> 00:06:55,000
I finally realized...

72
00:06:55,439 --> 00:06:57,439
...that maybe my connection with Jiangliu

73
00:06:57,639 --> 00:06:59,680
was never truly severed.

74
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:00,639
Back then,

75
00:07:00,959 --> 00:07:02,720
my mother took me back to our hometown.

76
00:07:03,079 --> 00:07:06,439
I guess she had already made up her mind.

77
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,279
After I gave birth,

78
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:10,519
she secretly took the baby away

79
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:13,480
and lied, saying the baby died at birth.

80
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,279
The truth is, she didn't want

81
00:07:15,279 --> 00:07:17,759
my life to be ruined by this child.

82
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,560
It's been nine years.

83
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:23,560
I finally have the courage to return here.

84
00:07:24,839 --> 00:07:25,519
Dad,

85
00:07:25,879 --> 00:07:26,639
actually,

86
00:07:27,399 --> 00:07:28,560
I really miss you.

87
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,839
I thought about it a lot,

88
00:07:32,759 --> 00:07:33,639
and I still feel

89
00:07:33,639 --> 00:07:35,319
that I need to tell you a few things.

90
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:37,160
Dad,

91
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:39,879
do you remember, a long time ago,

92
00:07:42,279 --> 00:07:44,120
there was someone I liked?

93
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:46,279
He was my college classmate

94
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:49,079
and my first boyfriend.

95
00:07:49,079 --> 00:07:51,279
Will you still remember tomorrow,

96
00:07:51,279 --> 00:07:53,439
the one who used to cry the most?

97
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:55,839
I have an exam!

98
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:58,000
But like most couples,

99
00:07:58,519 --> 00:07:59,920
we couldn't escape

100
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,879
the curse of breaking up after graduation.

101
00:08:03,639 --> 00:08:06,360
After college, I became a math teacher.

102
00:08:07,079 --> 00:08:08,839
That day was the Teacher appreciation banquet.

103
00:08:09,759 --> 00:08:10,839
I drank too much.

104
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:14,839
Yu Xiaoyue took me back to my dorm,

105
00:08:16,879 --> 00:08:18,079
and that's when it happened.

106
00:08:18,079 --> 00:08:18,920
What are you doing!

107
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,079
Let's call the police.

108
00:08:20,079 --> 00:08:21,199
His dad is a Supreme Court Justice.

109
00:08:21,519 --> 00:08:22,720
Calling the police won't do any good.

110
00:08:22,959 --> 00:08:25,399
I have to handle this my own way.

111
00:08:29,519 --> 00:08:31,399
Two weeks before that happened,

112
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:34,639
I ran into my first love by chance.

113
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,440
That night,

114
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,360
we both got drunk

115
00:08:39,039 --> 00:08:41,360
and had an unexpected night together.

116
00:08:45,159 --> 00:08:46,919
And this first love of mine

117
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:49,519
is your appellate lawyer,

118
00:08:50,799 --> 00:08:51,720
Zhao Yijie.

119
00:08:58,679 --> 00:08:59,639
I never expected

120
00:09:00,159 --> 00:09:01,480
that my secret

121
00:09:02,399 --> 00:09:04,639
would affect the fates of so many people.

122
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:07,440
Dad,

123
00:09:08,039 --> 00:09:10,559
the truth is, you and Yu Songfan

124
00:09:11,679 --> 00:09:13,440
both got the wrong person.

125
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:28,879
No need.

126
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:31,399
In a little while,

127
00:09:31,559 --> 00:09:33,000
we'll all be on the same side.

128
00:09:33,879 --> 00:09:35,519
We really are here to welcome you.

129
00:09:43,879 --> 00:09:45,159
Is everyone here?

130
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:47,759
The most important ones are already here.

131
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:52,200
Will there be a blood oath ceremony?

132
00:09:52,799 --> 00:09:54,120
Like making me kneel and bow or something?

133
00:09:54,679 --> 00:09:56,320
You watch too many movies.

134
00:09:56,639 --> 00:09:58,039
We're not a gang.

135
00:10:00,559 --> 00:10:01,200
Hello?

136
00:10:02,519 --> 00:10:03,279
It's me.

137
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,039
Yang Miao.

138
00:10:06,159 --> 00:10:07,159
I'm back.

139
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:13,480
Where are you?

140
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:15,000
I'm heading to Yu Songfan's house.

141
00:10:15,399 --> 00:10:16,799
I'm near there right now.

142
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,879
Why are you going there?

143
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:19,799
I came back

144
00:10:19,799 --> 00:10:21,559
because I know you adopted Awu.

145
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:23,120
Bring the kid over.

146
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,279
Let's clear it up in front of Yu Songfan.

147
00:10:24,279 --> 00:10:25,039
Listen... listen to me.

148
00:10:25,039 --> 00:10:26,759
It's not... it's not like that.

149
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:28,200
Let's talk when we meet.

150
00:10:28,759 --> 00:10:30,440
I want my dad's ashes back,

151
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:32,039
and I want to see Awu again.

152
00:10:32,799 --> 00:10:33,919
He's growing up.

153
00:10:34,159 --> 00:10:35,440
He has the right to know everything.

154
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,240
I'll wait for you at Yu Songfan's house.

155
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:38,519
Hello?

156
00:10:38,679 --> 00:10:39,440
Hello?

157
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,039
Ding Ning,

158
00:10:56,799 --> 00:10:57,720
I

159
00:10:58,960 --> 00:10:59,919
won't go in with you.

160
00:11:01,919 --> 00:11:02,600
Sorry.

161
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:54,320
Ding Ning is here.

162
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:57,440
Come, take a seat.

163
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,399
Why are you alone? Where's Zhao Yijie?

164
00:11:59,080 --> 00:11:59,960
He had something to do.

165
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:02,240
Drink up.

166
00:12:03,799 --> 00:12:04,519
Come, have a seat.

167
00:12:04,519 --> 00:12:05,360
I don't think I should sit here.

168
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:06,279
We saved it especially for you.

169
00:12:07,279 --> 00:12:07,919
Have a seat.

170
00:12:09,399 --> 00:12:10,200
These are all old friends here.

171
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,200
No need for introductions, right?

172
00:12:11,279 --> 00:12:12,200
We've met.

173
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:12,960
Ruqing.

174
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:15,120
Introduce Ding Ning to some new friends.

175
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:15,759
Okay.

176
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:17,720
Come, let's have a toast.

177
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:18,879
Thank you.

178
00:12:21,519 --> 00:12:22,159
And this is...

179
00:12:22,159 --> 00:12:25,120
Director Chen from the municipal office.

180
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:25,960
A pleasure to meet you.

181
00:12:48,519 --> 00:12:49,320
Awu.

182
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:50,960
Wait for me in the car.

183
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:52,440
I'll go bring Grandpa down, okay?

184
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:55,039
Hurry up, then. I'll wait for you.

185
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:55,919
Okay.

186
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:25,879
Ding Ning,

187
00:13:26,279 --> 00:13:28,919
I kept calling, but you didn't answer.

188
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:31,360
I want to tell you

189
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:32,240
I'm not waiting anymore.

190
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:34,120
I'm heading to Zhao Yijie's house right now

191
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:35,320
to get the kid back.

192
00:13:42,879 --> 00:13:43,559
Have a seat.

193
00:13:50,039 --> 00:13:51,360
I've picked out a nursing home for you.

194
00:13:52,039 --> 00:13:52,919
It's pretty nice.

195
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:54,600
So, have you thought about it?

196
00:13:55,759 --> 00:13:57,480
This right here is my nursing home.

197
00:13:58,080 --> 00:14:00,600
Awu and I will stay here for good.

198
00:14:07,919 --> 00:14:09,159
Did Yang Miao come here?

199
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:10,879
Yes.

200
00:14:11,879 --> 00:14:13,080
What does it have to do with you?

201
00:14:13,799 --> 00:14:14,559
Old Yu.

202
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:18,159
I came here today to apologize to you.

203
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:22,720
Actually, Yang Miao

204
00:14:24,519 --> 00:14:25,759
was my college classmate.

205
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:28,399
And...

206
00:14:29,879 --> 00:14:31,600
we used to date.

207
00:14:36,279 --> 00:14:37,360
During Yang Cheng's case,

208
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:41,039
I found out about her and your son.

209
00:14:44,519 --> 00:14:46,519
The prosecutors were watching me closely.

210
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:49,080
So I suddenly wondered if I should

211
00:14:50,399 --> 00:14:52,559
use the fact that Awu is your grandson

212
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:54,720
to get you to do some things for me.

213
00:14:57,399 --> 00:14:59,120
But when he turned four,

214
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:02,279
I suddenly realized...

215
00:15:06,759 --> 00:15:08,320
Awu is actually my son.

216
00:15:11,559 --> 00:15:12,360
Zhao Yijie.

217
00:15:14,919 --> 00:15:16,039
I really didn't expect

218
00:15:16,039 --> 00:15:18,159
that you liked Awu so much.

219
00:15:21,759 --> 00:15:24,919
Making up another story to bullshit me?

220
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:32,200
Let me tell you,

221
00:15:35,679 --> 00:15:37,879
you've done so many bad things.

222
00:15:38,919 --> 00:15:41,639
People have plenty of evidence against you.

223
00:15:42,480 --> 00:15:43,840
You can't escape.

224
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:45,320
Just turn yourself in, okay?

225
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:46,399
I know. I can...

226
00:15:46,399 --> 00:15:47,600
I can turn myself in.

227
00:15:47,600 --> 00:15:48,120
Then go!

228
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,360
And I can go to prison.

229
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:51,960
I had no choice but to do those things.

230
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:55,519
But I want you to have a good home.

231
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:59,200
I want Ding Ning to have a good future.

232
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:02,000
For what I've done to you all,

233
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:03,519
I am truly sorry.

234
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:04,440
I'm sorry.

235
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,759
And tonight, I'm taking Yang Awu with me.

236
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:11,399
Tonight.

237
00:16:12,879 --> 00:16:13,840
Zhao Yijie,

238
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:15,559
you're going on the run.

239
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:19,000
Why are you taking my grandson with you?

240
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:21,039
He is my son!

241
00:16:21,039 --> 00:16:22,480
He is my biological grandson!

242
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,279
Zhao Yijie!

243
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:24,720
Wake up!

244
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:26,559
All the paternity tests you got

245
00:16:26,559 --> 00:16:28,000
were tampered with by me.

246
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:29,519
Just give him back to me, okay?

247
00:16:29,519 --> 00:16:30,480
You're really out of your mind.

248
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:31,600
He is my son!

249
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:32,759
Are you crazy?

250
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:40,279
I am sick.

251
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:42,200
And because I'm sick,

252
00:16:42,799 --> 00:16:43,840
if I kill you,

253
00:16:43,919 --> 00:16:45,639
the law can't convict me, you know?

254
00:16:54,759 --> 00:16:55,559
That's enough.

255
00:16:57,559 --> 00:16:58,559
Have you vented enough?

256
00:17:02,080 --> 00:17:02,879
Yu Songfan,

257
00:17:03,559 --> 00:17:05,079
everything is my fault.

258
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:06,799
I deserve to die.

259
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:09,519
Yang Awu is my biological son.

260
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:10,559
You're lying!

261
00:17:12,559 --> 00:17:14,319
He is also my only hope.

262
00:17:16,359 --> 00:17:17,559
I can't let anything happen to him.

263
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:20,240
You're lying! You tricked me!

264
00:17:21,079 --> 00:17:22,680
Today is my only chance.

265
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:24,160
You're lying! Come back!

266
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:25,240
Zhao Yijie, come back!

267
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:26,559
I have to try.

268
00:17:33,839 --> 00:17:34,599
Awu!

269
00:17:41,759 --> 00:17:43,200
Why did you kill Xiao Lu?

270
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:43,640
Kevin...

271
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:45,920
He was my friend.

272
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:48,359
He was my only friend.

273
00:17:49,079 --> 00:17:49,799
Why?

274
00:17:50,119 --> 00:17:52,319
Why did you kill him?

275
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:53,519
Kevin!

276
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:05,880
Zhao Yijie!

277
00:18:12,759 --> 00:18:14,200
Zhao Yijie!

278
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:25,079
Grandpa, save him!

279
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:27,519
Grandpa, I beg you to save Zhao Yijie!

280
00:18:27,599 --> 00:18:29,160
I'm begging you to save Zhao Yijie!

281
00:18:30,359 --> 00:18:31,440
Save Zhao Yijie!

282
00:18:31,599 --> 00:18:33,000
Grandpa, save him!

283
00:18:33,839 --> 00:18:35,640
Grandpa, please save Zhao Yijie.

284
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:36,720
Grandpa!

285
00:18:37,200 --> 00:18:37,920
Awu.

286
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:39,359
Awu.

287
00:18:40,119 --> 00:18:42,640
Though I don't know what he does every day,

288
00:18:42,839 --> 00:18:43,839
I do know

289
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:47,559
the greatest man alive is Zhao Yijie,

290
00:18:48,759 --> 00:18:49,640
my dad.

291
00:18:55,839 --> 00:18:56,559
Awu!

292
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:00,319
Lawyer Xu,

293
00:19:00,319 --> 00:19:01,279
let me offer you a toast.

294
00:19:02,599 --> 00:19:03,559
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

295
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:08,000
Everyone's waiting for you. Come quick.

296
00:19:11,599 --> 00:19:13,440
Come on, let's toast to Ding Ning.

297
00:19:13,559 --> 00:19:14,319
Alright?

298
00:19:14,319 --> 00:19:16,319
Come on, come on.

299
00:19:16,559 --> 00:19:17,359
Mr. Bi,

300
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:19,119
sometimes I wonder,

301
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:20,799
as for all of us,

302
00:19:21,240 --> 00:19:23,599
what exactly brought us together.

303
00:19:26,160 --> 00:19:27,480
Zhao Yijie, Zhao Yijie!

304
00:19:28,319 --> 00:19:29,559
Zhao Yijie!

305
00:19:30,359 --> 00:19:31,680
For the sake of so-called love

306
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:32,880
and so-called justice,

307
00:19:33,759 --> 00:19:36,079
how many shackles have we put on ourselves,

308
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:38,079
and how many people have we hurt?

309
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:41,839
Zhao Yijie! Zhao Yijie!

310
00:19:42,680 --> 00:19:45,160
Zhao Yijie! Zhao Yijie!

311
00:19:45,519 --> 00:19:47,720
You stay here with Grandpa, alright?

312
00:19:47,720 --> 00:19:48,559
Save him, quick!

313
00:19:48,559 --> 00:19:50,039
I'll call 120 right now.

314
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:51,960
Come with me first.

315
00:19:52,359 --> 00:19:53,559
We need to leave this place.

316
00:19:53,559 --> 00:19:54,759
He will be fine.

317
00:19:55,319 --> 00:19:57,680
I'm begging you. I'm begging you!

318
00:19:58,079 --> 00:19:59,480
I'm begging you!

319
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:11,440
And the people we long to see,

320
00:20:11,759 --> 00:20:13,440
the world we hope for,

321
00:20:13,519 --> 00:20:15,400
the regrets we wish to amend,

322
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:18,359
all make us, as we pursue them,

323
00:20:18,359 --> 00:20:20,680
taste loneliness, separation,

324
00:20:21,039 --> 00:20:23,160
weariness, and pain.

325
00:20:23,759 --> 00:20:24,920
Hello, is this 120?

326
00:20:26,319 --> 00:20:27,359
And so I wonder,

327
00:20:28,079 --> 00:20:31,319
if so-called love and justice

328
00:20:32,039 --> 00:20:34,160
are nothing but fleeting illusions,

329
00:20:34,799 --> 00:20:35,839
will they unknowingly

330
00:20:35,839 --> 00:20:37,480
destroy everything we cling to?

331
00:20:39,519 --> 00:20:41,799
Even if we achieve our initial desires,

332
00:20:42,400 --> 00:20:44,000
what meaning is left in the end?

333
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:00,200
Zhao Yijie!

334
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:02,759
Zhao Yijie! Zhao Yijie!

335
00:21:03,359 --> 00:21:05,720
Mr. Yu! Mr. Yu! Awu!

336
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:07,000
What happened?

337
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:07,759
Zhao Yijie!

338
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:09,640
Zhao Yijie! Wake up! Zhao Yijie!

339
00:21:09,640 --> 00:21:10,960
Zhao Yijie! What happened to you?

340
00:21:13,359 --> 00:21:15,200
Hello? Hello? Is this 120?

341
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:18,039
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry up!

342
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:20,119
Zhao Yijie! Zhao Yijie!

343
00:21:22,880 --> 00:21:23,720
Okay, okay.

344
00:21:23,920 --> 00:21:24,759
Come, come, come.

345
00:21:25,480 --> 00:21:26,319
Please look out for me.

346
00:21:32,079 --> 00:21:33,559
Come, let's have a drink.

347
00:21:33,559 --> 00:21:34,799
Alright then, enjoy your meal.

348
00:21:35,759 --> 00:21:36,640
Excuse me.

349
00:21:38,279 --> 00:21:39,119
It's fine, it's fine.

350
00:21:39,839 --> 00:21:41,400
I'll go to the restroom to clean up.

351
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:43,400
Ding Ning.

352
00:21:46,599 --> 00:21:49,200
Where there is light, there are shadows.

353
00:21:50,160 --> 00:21:51,359
Only when you stand in the light

354
00:21:51,640 --> 00:21:52,880
will your shadow truly be yours.

355
00:21:57,640 --> 00:21:59,000
You know what kind of person you are,

356
00:22:00,359 --> 00:22:01,400
you can't lie to yourself.

357
00:22:27,119 --> 00:22:27,799
Move out.

358
00:22:40,279 --> 00:22:41,960
The provincial procuratorate has approved

359
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:43,559
the arrest of Bi Wenhao's gang.

360
00:22:43,720 --> 00:22:45,759
The municipal bureau is now assisting.

361
00:22:50,799 --> 00:22:51,759
Here is the arrest warrant.

362
00:22:52,160 --> 00:22:55,039
Bi Wenhao and associates are under arrest.

363
00:23:10,079 --> 00:23:11,519
Everyone, hands on the table.

364
00:23:12,039 --> 00:23:13,000
Stand up slowly.

365
00:23:13,359 --> 00:23:14,279
All of you, stand up.

366
00:23:31,680 --> 00:23:32,319
Stand up.

367
00:24:21,720 --> 00:24:22,319
Wrap it up.

368
00:24:22,640 --> 00:24:23,960
Wrap it up. Take them away.

369
00:24:34,279 --> 00:24:35,440
Old Yu, where are you?

370
00:24:35,440 --> 00:24:36,400
Pick up the phone!

371
00:24:51,279 --> 00:24:52,680
Driver, please turn around.

372
00:24:52,680 --> 00:24:54,640
Catch up to that silver car, okay?

373
00:24:54,640 --> 00:24:55,079
Okay.

374
00:24:55,079 --> 00:24:55,599
Thank you.

375
00:25:01,400 --> 00:25:02,519
Right, the one just ahead.

376
00:25:02,519 --> 00:25:03,559
That silver one.

377
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:12,799
Grandpa, save Zhao Yijie!

378
00:25:13,880 --> 00:25:15,720
Save Zhao Yijie!

379
00:25:16,559 --> 00:25:18,400
Save Zhao Yijie!

380
00:25:19,799 --> 00:25:21,319
I want to go back.

381
00:25:21,839 --> 00:25:23,480
Zhao Yijie is bleeding a lot.

382
00:25:23,880 --> 00:25:24,720
Grandpa!

383
00:25:24,799 --> 00:25:26,440
Grandpa, please save Zhao Yijie!

384
00:25:26,519 --> 00:25:28,359
Grandpa, please save Zhao Yijie!

385
00:25:28,359 --> 00:25:30,680
Grandpa, you have to save Zhao Yijie!

386
00:25:30,680 --> 00:25:33,039
I'm begging you to save Zhao Yijie!

387
00:25:33,240 --> 00:25:35,160
Grandpa, please save Zhao Yijie!

388
00:25:35,160 --> 00:25:36,160
What's wrong, Awu?

389
00:25:36,559 --> 00:25:37,599
Awu, what's wrong with you?

390
00:25:38,279 --> 00:25:39,640
Grandpa, watch out!

391
00:25:49,039 --> 00:25:51,000
Grandpa, I'm scared.

392
00:25:57,799 --> 00:25:59,319
Why aren't you answering the phone?

393
00:26:08,920 --> 00:26:10,440
Do you even know how to drive?!

394
00:26:10,839 --> 00:26:11,599
Why aren't we moving?

395
00:26:11,599 --> 00:26:12,759
What's going on up ahead?

396
00:26:12,759 --> 00:26:13,839
Why is there a traffic jam?

397
00:26:13,839 --> 00:26:15,680
Driver, can I get out here?

398
00:26:16,119 --> 00:26:16,400
Sure.

399
00:26:16,400 --> 00:26:16,920
Thanks.

400
00:26:24,319 --> 00:26:25,680
Where are we going, Awu?

401
00:26:25,759 --> 00:26:27,160
I want to go home.

402
00:26:35,920 --> 00:26:38,599
Look, look.

403
00:26:39,359 --> 00:26:40,599
It's them.

404
00:27:29,519 --> 00:27:31,000
A car fell into the water!

405
00:27:31,319 --> 00:27:32,160
Call 120!

406
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:38,279
Yu Songfan!

407
00:27:40,519 --> 00:27:41,720
Yu Songfan!

408
00:27:43,920 --> 00:27:45,079
Yu Songfan!

409
00:27:59,400 --> 00:28:00,880
Yu Songfan!

410
00:28:24,119 --> 00:28:25,759
Residential surveillance is over.

411
00:28:25,759 --> 00:28:27,799
Thank you for assisting the investigation, Lawyer Ding.

412
00:28:31,079 --> 00:28:32,160
That's very formal.

413
00:28:32,799 --> 00:28:34,000
It gets even more formal.

414
00:28:34,000 --> 00:28:34,880
Want to hear it?

415
00:28:35,319 --> 00:28:35,920
Go ahead.

416
00:28:38,880 --> 00:28:40,640
Everyone was arrested this time.

417
00:28:43,279 --> 00:28:44,759
Most of them confessed to everything.

418
00:28:45,160 --> 00:28:46,000
Not a single one of them

419
00:28:46,000 --> 00:28:47,519
can escape justice.

420
00:28:47,559 --> 00:28:49,920
And no one will be a scapegoat anymore.

421
00:28:50,640 --> 00:28:51,599
According to the confessions,

422
00:28:51,799 --> 00:28:53,839
the entire syndicate led by Bi Wenhao

423
00:28:53,839 --> 00:28:56,079
is suspected of Giving and accepting bribes,

424
00:28:56,079 --> 00:28:58,400
Involved in nearly a hundred cases.

425
00:28:58,599 --> 00:29:00,119
When you get out and see the news,

426
00:29:00,119 --> 00:29:01,160
you'll realize

427
00:29:01,200 --> 00:29:03,039
that it's a whole new world out there.

428
00:29:03,400 --> 00:29:04,599
And in all of this,

429
00:29:05,319 --> 00:29:07,359
half the credit goes to you.

430
00:29:09,079 --> 00:29:09,839
Also,

431
00:29:10,599 --> 00:29:12,279
Bi Wenhao's son, Kevin,

432
00:29:12,279 --> 00:29:13,400
was sentenced to life in prison.

433
00:29:15,799 --> 00:29:16,880
What about the rest of them?

434
00:29:20,599 --> 00:29:21,799
As for Zhao Yijie,

435
00:29:23,039 --> 00:29:25,079
even though Yang Miao found him in time

436
00:29:25,079 --> 00:29:26,240
and got him immediate medical attention,

437
00:29:26,640 --> 00:29:28,079
he lost too much blood.

438
00:29:28,200 --> 00:29:29,359
He's still in a coma,

439
00:29:29,559 --> 00:29:31,119
and we don't know when he'll wake up.

440
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:36,799
So,

441
00:29:37,480 --> 00:29:39,559
Zhao Yijie really is Yang Awu's...

442
00:29:40,960 --> 00:29:43,240
With Yu Songfan's paternity test,

443
00:29:43,240 --> 00:29:44,480
tampering with the results

444
00:29:44,759 --> 00:29:46,440
for Zhao Yijie back then

445
00:29:46,720 --> 00:29:47,799
wouldn't have been hard, right?

446
00:29:54,160 --> 00:29:55,839
Plus, while Zhao Yijie was on the run,

447
00:29:55,839 --> 00:29:56,880
he reached out to me himself.

448
00:29:57,720 --> 00:29:58,960
He wanted to work with me

449
00:29:58,960 --> 00:30:00,839
to trick you into arresting Bi Wenhao.

450
00:30:02,720 --> 00:30:05,519
So your intuition back then was right.

451
00:30:07,039 --> 00:30:08,480
Mr. Bi is so cunning;

452
00:30:08,559 --> 00:30:09,880
he must have suspected him early on.

453
00:30:10,720 --> 00:30:12,720
So the safest plan was

454
00:30:12,799 --> 00:30:13,799
for me to step in,

455
00:30:13,799 --> 00:30:15,319
and have you assist me from behind.

456
00:30:16,960 --> 00:30:18,440
But we still got played by him.

457
00:30:19,599 --> 00:30:20,319
Yeah.

458
00:30:21,240 --> 00:30:22,519
So at the time,

459
00:30:22,759 --> 00:30:25,359
neither Bi Wenhao nor I expected

460
00:30:25,400 --> 00:30:27,400
that he'd take neither side in the end.

461
00:30:27,440 --> 00:30:28,960
He just wanted to stall for time,

462
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:30,119
and ultimately pull a Disappearing act.

463
00:30:30,359 --> 00:30:32,119
He bypassed both me and Bi Wenhao,

464
00:30:32,160 --> 00:30:33,079
having planned it for a long time.

465
00:30:33,240 --> 00:30:35,680
He wanted to flee abroad with Yang Awu.

466
00:30:39,319 --> 00:30:40,920
He must have long looked forward to it.

467
00:30:42,559 --> 00:30:44,119
The father and son leaving everything,

468
00:30:44,559 --> 00:30:46,680
going somewhere else to start anew,

469
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:50,519
and living a truly ordinary life.

470
00:30:52,359 --> 00:30:53,720
But who would've expected this outcome.

471
00:31:02,039 --> 00:31:02,960
What about Old Yu?

472
00:31:05,559 --> 00:31:06,960
He took Yang Awu with him,

473
00:31:08,079 --> 00:31:09,279
and their whereabouts are still unknown.

474
00:31:11,000 --> 00:31:12,400
I know you really want to see him,

475
00:31:12,960 --> 00:31:14,400
but he has a new identity now.

476
00:31:15,200 --> 00:31:16,160
A wanted fugitive.

477
00:31:16,759 --> 00:31:18,440
But if I ever see him one day,

478
00:31:18,920 --> 00:31:20,240
I'll let you know right away.

479
00:31:27,799 --> 00:31:29,440
If that day really comes,

480
00:31:33,279 --> 00:31:34,799
I want to defend him myself.

481
00:31:45,960 --> 00:31:48,079
Let's go. Let's go home.

482
00:32:06,440 --> 00:32:07,720
Daddy's gonna hide now.

483
00:32:07,720 --> 00:32:08,880
Count to ten.

484
00:32:08,880 --> 00:32:09,680
Okay.

485
00:32:11,839 --> 00:32:15,920
Ten, nine, eight, seven...

486
00:32:16,319 --> 00:32:22,160
Six, five, four, three, two, one!

487
00:32:24,200 --> 00:32:25,920
Daddy, I see you!

488
00:32:34,759 --> 00:32:35,440
Daddy!

489
00:32:57,759 --> 00:32:59,480
When he sees the trees here,

490
00:32:59,599 --> 00:33:00,559
will he get used to them?

491
00:33:00,559 --> 00:33:01,319
I don't know.

492
00:33:01,319 --> 00:33:03,160
Mountain trees have their own character,

493
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:04,319
and their own names.

494
00:33:04,480 --> 00:33:05,519
But the trees in the city

495
00:33:05,519 --> 00:33:06,799
are all pruned so uniformly.

496
00:33:07,000 --> 00:33:08,680
A life as untamed as Yang Awu's,

497
00:33:08,720 --> 00:33:09,799
so free,

498
00:33:09,880 --> 00:33:11,599
and so full of vitality.

499
00:33:11,640 --> 00:33:12,839
While they are still alive,

500
00:33:12,839 --> 00:33:13,640
they've already dug the hole

501
00:33:13,640 --> 00:33:15,680
where they'll be buried after death.

502
00:33:16,279 --> 00:33:17,400
That means he wants to

503
00:33:18,359 --> 00:33:20,519
leave his final nutrients

504
00:33:20,519 --> 00:33:21,920
to the tree he loves most.

505
00:33:23,160 --> 00:33:24,880
Just like how city people

506
00:33:26,039 --> 00:33:27,960
leave their inheritance to loved ones.

507
00:36:03,480 --> 00:36:04,159
Awu.

508
00:36:07,159 --> 00:36:10,519
First, Grandpa wants to say sorry to you.

509
00:36:11,079 --> 00:36:12,559
Because Grandpa

510
00:36:14,480 --> 00:36:17,079
did things that upset you today.

511
00:36:19,320 --> 00:36:22,360
Even though you scratched Grandpa's hand,

512
00:36:22,360 --> 00:36:24,039
Grandpa doesn't blame you.

513
00:36:24,599 --> 00:36:25,679
And also,

514
00:36:25,840 --> 00:36:27,199
ever since you were little,

515
00:36:27,440 --> 00:36:28,800
you've been passed around,

516
00:36:30,639 --> 00:36:32,800
never meeting your parents.

517
00:36:34,480 --> 00:36:36,039
Grandpa feels that this

518
00:36:37,480 --> 00:36:39,119
is what he should apologize for most.

519
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:42,199
Grandpa's heart aches for you.

520
00:36:43,719 --> 00:36:45,920
In the adult world,

521
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:48,639
there are many things we can't control.

522
00:36:49,239 --> 00:36:50,599
All Grandpa can say is,

523
00:36:53,840 --> 00:36:55,360
Grandpa will protect you.

524
00:36:56,320 --> 00:36:57,960
Grandpa is much older than you.

525
00:36:58,199 --> 00:37:01,239
Grandpa will leave this world before you.

526
00:37:01,480 --> 00:37:03,880
But Grandpa really wants to see you, Awu,

527
00:37:05,039 --> 00:37:06,719
grow up bit by bit.

528
00:37:08,480 --> 00:37:10,320
Grandpa wants to stay by your side,

529
00:37:10,679 --> 00:37:12,679
and watch you become an adult,

530
00:37:13,519 --> 00:37:15,559
watch you have your own family,

531
00:37:17,559 --> 00:37:20,039
watch you have... have your own children.

532
00:37:42,559 --> 00:37:44,119
But what Grandpa fears most is...

533
00:37:44,519 --> 00:37:45,159
I...

534
00:37:47,400 --> 00:37:48,639
I will forget you.

535
00:37:53,920 --> 00:37:56,000
If one day you see me, Awu,

536
00:37:58,360 --> 00:37:59,840
but I don't remember you,

537
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:07,400
don't be afraid.

538
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:32,400
Everyone goes through the cycle of life,

539
00:38:33,079 --> 00:38:33,840
right?

540
00:38:36,880 --> 00:38:38,000
Grandpa loves you.

541
00:38:41,119 --> 00:38:42,639
Grandpa is sorry, Awu.

542
00:39:03,559 --> 00:39:05,039
Suddenly, I'm not used to this.

543
00:39:10,000 --> 00:39:13,679
There isn't a single sound here.

544
00:39:14,400 --> 00:39:16,960
It's like you're the only person on Earth.

545
00:39:22,360 --> 00:39:23,559
I really want to find you,

546
00:39:25,000 --> 00:39:26,440
to chat with you, Ding Ning.

547
00:39:27,000 --> 00:39:31,480
I suddenly have so much to say to you.

548
00:39:32,920 --> 00:39:33,719
I think...

549
00:39:38,159 --> 00:39:38,800
I...

550
00:39:41,880 --> 00:39:43,480
I had actually gotten used to it.

551
00:39:44,599 --> 00:39:46,079
Being all alone.

552
00:39:47,840 --> 00:39:48,760
It's been nine years.

553
00:39:51,320 --> 00:39:52,840
I even told my doctor,

554
00:39:54,599 --> 00:39:55,639
"Let it be."

555
00:39:56,639 --> 00:39:58,280
This Alzheimer's disease...

556
00:39:59,239 --> 00:40:00,199
is actually pretty good.

557
00:40:04,880 --> 00:40:06,760
It lets me forget...

558
00:40:11,719 --> 00:40:15,840
forget every single thing from the past.

559
00:40:17,480 --> 00:40:18,079
But...

560
00:40:21,079 --> 00:40:22,800
Ding Ning and Awu showed up.

561
00:40:23,840 --> 00:40:26,480
It was like I was completely broke,

562
00:40:26,960 --> 00:40:29,239
and then I won the lottery.

563
00:40:30,519 --> 00:40:32,239
And now you've disappeared again.

564
00:40:35,559 --> 00:40:37,440
I know my fate.

565
00:40:37,719 --> 00:40:40,599
I'm bound to forget absolutely everything.

566
00:40:43,679 --> 00:40:46,880
After I forget everything,

567
00:40:50,159 --> 00:40:51,079
